                        "entry_id": "afdfe142-f977-3e19-9547-2e933e43acc7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The nerve-dense, retractable fold of skin which covers and protects the head of the penis in humans and some other mammals."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e7aa281-104d-4099-8e0c-c1b47e7c8af4",
                                "sense_id": "fd8c0072-c7a4-3632-ad61-419deed1a9c8",
                                "text": "the foreskin is a primary sensory part of the penis, containing some of the most sensitive areas of the penis"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "31a23f33-be01-4c3a-bd34-153593257a5a",
                                "sense_id": "fd8c0072-c7a4-3632-ad61-419deed1a9c8",
                                "text": "In the female genitalia, the clitoral hood is homologous to the foreskin."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa84c9ae-9915-4f5e-8a52-a7197e974508",
                                "sense_id": "fd8c0072-c7a4-3632-ad61-419deed1a9c8",
                                "text": "And the vncircumcised man-child, whose flesh of his foreskinne is not circumcised, that soule shall be cut off from his people: hee hath broken my couenant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b313f552-b0e1-4ca7-bfc1-c93fb86a99c6",
                                "sense_id": "fd8c0072-c7a4-3632-ad61-419deed1a9c8",
                                "text": "In primates, the foreskin is present in the genitalia of both sexes and likely has been present for millions of years of evolution."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
